---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story | Why Ecosoft"
  description="From a shared belief in open source — to Thailand's most trusted ERP partner. The Ecosoft story since 2013."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 44rem;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
        <h1>From a shared belief in open source — to Thailand's most trusted ERP partner.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Ten years. Forty-plus projects. Every one delivered. Every client still with us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDING STORY -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 50rem;">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Beginning</p>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">A conviction that businesses should own their own systems</h2>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.75;">
        <p>
          Ecosoft was founded on a simple but radical conviction: that businesses should own their own systems.
          At the time, the ERP market was dominated by expensive proprietary software — SAP, Oracle, Microsoft
          Dynamics — with licence fees that excluded all but the largest enterprises, and vendor relationships
          that made switching nearly impossible.
        </p>
        <p>
          We saw a different path. Open-source ERP platforms like Odoo and ERPNext were maturing rapidly, and we
          believed that with the right implementation expertise — expertise grounded in how Thai businesses actually
          operate — these systems could deliver enterprise-grade power without enterprise-grade cost or lock-in.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ten years and forty-plus projects later, that conviction has been validated by clients ranging from
          satellite manufacturers to government science agencies to plastic packaging factories. Every project
          delivered. Every client still with us.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--text); font-weight: 600;">
          Today, Ecosoft is the only Thai company that is both an active OCA member and a certified ERPNext
          partner. We don't just implement the software — we contribute to building it. That depth is what
          sets us apart.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">A Decade of Growth</p>
        <h2>Key milestones since 2013</h2>
      </header>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem;">
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2013</p>
          <h3>Ecosoft Founded</h3>
          <p>First Odoo implementation in Thailand — Raja Cycle, a bicycle manufacturer that has been with us ever since.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2015</p>
          <h3>OCA Membership Achieved</h3>
          <p>Ecosoft becomes Thailand's first and only OCA member — the global standards body for open-source Odoo development.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2018</p>
          <h3>Government Breakthrough</h3>
          <p>NSTDA — Thailand's national science agency — replaces SAP with Ecosoft's Odoo implementation. A landmark project that opened the door to the public sector.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2020</p>
          <h3>ERPNext Partnership</h3>
          <p>Ecosoft becomes a certified ERPNext partner, adding the Frappe ecosystem to our portfolio and expanding our open-source capabilities.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2022</p>
          <h3>Space Technology</h3>
          <p>EOS Orbit — Thailand's first satellite manufacturer — chooses ERPNext with Ecosoft. Our most complex and high-profile project to date.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">2024</p>
          <h3>120+ Modules Contributed</h3>
          <p>Ecosoft crosses 120 open-source modules contributed to the global OCA and Frappe communities — including the definitive Thai accounting localisation suite.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT DRIVES US -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">What Drives Us</p>
        <h2>Three beliefs that have never changed</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
          <h3>Ownership Matters</h3>
          <p>A business that doesn't own its own systems is a business at risk. Every client we work with receives full source code — no exceptions, no add-on fees.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
          <h3>Business Understanding Before Technology</h3>
          <p>ERP fails when the implementor doesn't understand the client's business. We invest more time in discovery and process design than most firms spend on the whole project.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
          <h3>Quality Is Non-Negotiable</h3>
          <p>We build to OCA standards because our clients deserve systems that work in five years, not just at go-live. Cutting corners is how ERP projects fail.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">04</span>
          <h3>Partnership, Not Projects</h3>
          <p>We measure success in years, not months. Most of our clients from 2013 are still with us. That long-term relationship is what we optimise for — not short-term revenue.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container cta-strip-grid">
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Ready to be our next success story?</h3>
        <p>Start with a free consultation — we'll tell you honestly if we're the right fit.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Want to see our work?</h3>
        <p>Read case studies from manufacturing, government, and technology clients.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies" class="btn btn-teal-outline">View Case Studies →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
